              </Toolbar>
              <CustomData>GroundGame Topdown 0.3
Page 1: 1 CHECK | 2 camera SCAN | 3 TEST 10s | 4 live LAUNCH 10s | 5 ABORT | 6 AIM side camera | 7 down camera | 8 LOCK camera centerline | 9 ABORT.
Exterior START begins a 10 second timer; ABORT cancels it. Flashing amber lamp means countdown. Camera scan has a 750m range budget and thin rays can miss small ships. LOCK uses an active camera, or the Forward side camera. Enemy grids only.
Gamepad bank 1: Up CHECK, Left SCAN, Right TEST 10s, Down ABORT. Bank 2: Up LAUNCH 10s, Left AIM camera, Right down camera, Down ABORT. Bank 3: Up LOCK, Left STATUS, Right SCAN, Down ABORT.</CustomData>
            </MyObjectBuilder_CubeBlock>
